 ⚾ The Tampa Bay Rays forced a World Series Game 5, stunning the seemingly invincible Brewers with a two-run rally in the 12th inning for a 4-3 walk-off win . The game took 4 hours and 20 minutes, ending at 12:30 a.m. ET. Keep reading . 

 
 
